k:#F97583\">double</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> radius</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(color);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        this</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.radius </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> radius;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Override</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> double</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> area</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Math.PI </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> radius </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> radius;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>接口与抽象类的区别在于：接口定义行为契约（<code>implements</code>），抽象类提供部分实现（<code>extends</code>）。Java 8 之后接口可包含 <code>default</code> 方法，模糊了两者的界限但各自的设计语义仍然不同。</p>\n<h3 id=\"集合框架与泛型\">集合框架与泛型</h3><p>Java 集合框架分为 <code>Collection</code>（List、Set、Queue）和 <code>Map</code> 两大体系：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>接口</th>\n<th>常用实现</th>\n<th>特性</th>\n<th>时间复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>List</td>\n<td>ArrayList</td>\n<td>随机访问快</td>\n<td>get <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>, add <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>List</td>\n<td>LinkedList</td>\n<td>插入删除快</td>\n<td>get <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>, add <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Set</td>\n<td>HashSet</td>\n<td>无序去重</td>\n<td>add/contains <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Map</td>\n<td>HashMap</td>\n<td>键值对存储</td>\n<td>get/put <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Map</td>\n<td>TreeMap</td>\n<td>有序键值对</td>\n<td>get/put <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>泛型通过类型参数化避免了强制类型转换，编译期即可发现类型错误：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"List&lt;String&gt; names = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;();&#10;names.add(&quot;Spring&quot;);&#10;// names.add(123); // 编译错误，类型安全\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> names </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ArrayList&#x3C;>();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">names.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">add</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Spring\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// names.add(123); // 编译错误，类型安全</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"io-与-nio\">IO 与 NIO</h3><p>传统 IO 基于字节流（<code>InputStream/OutputStream</code>）和字符流（<code>Reader/Writer</code>），采用阻塞式模型。NIO 引入 <code>Channel</code>、<code>Buffer</code>、<code>Selector</code> 三组件，支持非阻塞多路复用：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// NIO 文件读取&#10;Path path = Path.of(&quot;data.txt&quot;);&#10;List&lt;String&gt; lines = Files.readAllLines(path, StandardCharsets.UTF_8);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// NIO 文件读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Path path </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Path.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"data.txt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">List&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">String</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> lines </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Files.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">readAllLines</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(path, StandardCharsets.UTF_8);</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"多线程与并发\">多线程与并发</h3><p>Java 并发编程的核心概念包括线程生命周期、同步机制和线程池：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"ExecutorService pool = Executors.newFixedThreadPool(4);&#10;Future&lt;Integer&gt; future = pool.submit(() -&gt; {&#10;    // 耗时计算&#10;    return computeResult();&#10;});&#10;Integer result = future.get(); // 阻塞获取结果\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">ExecutorService pool </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Executors.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">newFixedThreadPool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Future&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Integer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> future </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pool.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">submit</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 耗时计算</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> computeResult</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Integer result </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> future.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(); </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 阻塞获取结果</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>synchronized</code> 关键字和 <code>ReentrantLock</code> 解决临界区互斥问题；<code>volatile</code> 保证变量可见性；<code>ConcurrentHashMap</code> 提供线程安全的高性能 Map 实现。</p>\n<h3 id=\"spring-boot-初步\">Spring Boot 初步</h3><p>Spring Boot 通过&quot;约定优于配置&quot;思想极大降低了企业级应用的搭建门槛：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"@RestController&#10;@RequestMapping(&quot;/api/users&quot;)&#10;public class UserController {&#10;&#10;    @Autowired&#10;    private UserService userService;&#10;&#10;    @GetMapping(&quot;/{id}&quot;)&#10;    public ResponseEntity&lt;User&gt; getUser(@PathVariable Long id) {&#10;        return ResponseEntity.ok(userService.findById(id));&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RestController</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RequestMapping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/api/users\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">public</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserController</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">Autowired</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    private</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> UserService userService;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GetMapping</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/{id}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    public</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ResponseEntity&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">> </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">getUser</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(@</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">PathVariable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Long </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ResponseEntity.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ok</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(userService.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">findById</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(id));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>Spring Boot Starter 机制将常用功能（Web、JPA、Security）封装为开箱即用的依赖包，开发者只需在 <code>pom.xml</code> 或 <code>build.gradle</code> 中引入即可。</p>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026 年 Java 生态的主要演进方向：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Java 23/24 LTS</strong>：虚拟线程（Virtual Threads）正式进入 LTS 版本，彻底改变了 Java 并发编程模型，百万级并发连接不再需要响应式框架</li>\n<li><strong>GraalVM Native Image</strong>：Spring Boot 3.x 原生支持 AOT 编译，启动时间降至毫秒级，容器化部署更轻量</li>\n<li><strong>AI 辅助 Java 开发</strong>：Copilot 和 Cursor 可自动生成 CRUD 代码、单元测试和文档注释，开发者角色从&quot;逐行编码&quot;转向&quot;设计与审查&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>Project Loom + Structured Concurrency</strong>：结构化并发 API 让异步代码像同步代码一样易读易调试</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p>设计一个图书管理系统的类层次：<code>Book</code>、<code>EBook</code>、<code>AudioBook</code> 继承自抽象类，实现 <code>Searchable</code> 接口。要求使用泛型集合存储图书，并提供按书名和 ISBN 两种查找方式。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>使用 <code>CompletableFuture</code> 实现并行调用三个外部 API（获取用户信息、订单列表、推荐商品），将结果聚合为一个 DTO 返回。对比串行调用与并行调用的耗时差异。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p>创建一个 Spring Boot 项目，实现用户注册登录的 RESTful API，要求使用分层架构（Controller → Service → Repository），并编写至少 3 个单元测试。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Java 程序设计是软件技术专业的第一门核心课程。面向对象设计赋予代码良好的结构和可维护性；集合与泛型提供了类型安全的数据操作手段；IO/NIO 和多线程解决了实际应用中的性能与并发需求；Spring Boot 则将这些能力整合为可快速交付的企业级应用。掌握 Java 编程后，后续的 Web 开发、微服务架构、软件测试等课程都将建立在这一基础之上。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Java 程序设计","id":"java-程序设计"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"面向对象编程核心","id":"面向对象编程核心"},{"level":3,"text":"集合框架与泛型","id":"集合框架与泛型"},{"level":3,"text":"IO 与 NIO","id":"io-与-nio"},{"level":3,"text":"多线程与并发","id":"多线程与并发"},{"level":3,"text":"Spring Boot 初步","id":"spring-boot-初步"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"数据结构与算法","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/software-technology/programming-fundamentals/data-structures-algorithms"}}